UID:SAMPLE-DRP-004-approvals_ask@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270302
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270303
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-DRP-004: Ask each office on the route about this brand (tem
 plate 01). (you)
DESCRIPTION:Ask each office on the route about this brand (template 01). A
 n office's first three drops need its explicit yes\; after that\, notice a
 t least five business days ahead and it comes unless they say no.\nLog it 
 in: approvals rows: asked_date
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-DRP-004-building_coi@campaign-ops
