DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270316
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270317
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-DRP-004: Direct-ship (you)
DESCRIPTION:Direct-ship: receive the reserve\, and the cartons of any offi
 ce you deliver by hand\, and count them\; check one package of each flavor
 : best-by\, lot\, and the allergen line word for word. The campaign's chec
 ks compare the reserve with what was due ("reserve: received X of Y")\; th
 e office cartons are checked from T+1.\nLog it in: inventory: received wit
 h office_id blank (the reserve and the cases you will carry)\, lot\, best_
 by
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
