DESCRIPTION:Direct-ship: mail each office its tent cards (one per brand pl
 us a spare)\, to arrive by T-1\; the T-3 email (template 03) says the enve
 lope is coming and asks for the count of each carton. Offices you deliver 
 by hand get their cards with the case.\nLog it in: stops: kit_mailed_date\
 ; costs: other_direct (postage)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
