BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-DRP-004-confirm@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270322
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270323
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-DRP-004: Text each pantry owner to confirm (template 04). P
 ack one la (you)
DESCRIPTION:Text each pantry owner to confirm (template 04). Pack one labe
 led case per office per brand against the kit checklist (direct-ship: only
  the cases you deliver by hand)\; bag and label the reserve. Print the rou
 te sheet (direct-ship: the tracking sheet). Charge the phone\, load the ha
 nd truck. Read every link's total after your test scans and log it as the 
 baseline.\nLog it in: stops: confirm_text_sent_date\; scans: baseline
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-DRP-004-drop_ds@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270323
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270324
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-DRP-004: Direct-ship (carrier and office)
DESCRIPTION:Direct-ship: watch tracking from 8 am. Each office counts the 
 units in each carton and texts the count with the placement photo. Log\, p
 er office per brand\, a received row (office_id\, the office's count\, cou
 nt_source office_count\, lot and best-by from the brand's ship notice) and
  a delivered row with the same count\, so the reserve stays right and the 
 financial model's units_received is every unit the brand sent. A carton re
 fused at the door: outcome declined\, no received or delivered row (the ca
 rrier returns it to the brand). A short or damaged carton: an issue for th
 at office\, tell the brand today\, top up from reserve on day 3. Visit eve
 ry office whose first drop this is\, and deliver by hand to the offices wh
 ose front desk will not hold food (delivered rows only\, founder_count).\n
 Log it in: stops: outcome\; inventory: received and delivered (office_coun
 t)\; photos\; counts\; issues
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-DRP-004-placement_confirm@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270324
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270325
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-DRP-004: Placement confirmation to each brand (template 06)
  (you)
DESCRIPTION:Placement confirmation to each brand (template 06): the office
 s placed by today\, each with its photo. Office not placed by today\, or t
 urned away at the door: credit note row and refund or take it off the bala
 nce ($120 founding\, $150 standard)\; the campaign's checks say "credit du
 e from T+1" until the credit notes cover it. Standard: issue the balance i
 nvoice today.\nLog it in: invoices: credit_note\, standard_balance
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
