UID:SAMPLE-DRP-004-day3@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270325
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270326
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-DRP-004: Day 3 (you and office)
DESCRIPTION:Day 3: ask each office for a count (template 07)\; top up from
  reserve where empty\; nudge any office under five responses. Read the lin
 ks (mid).\nLog it in: counts: remaining_day3\; inventory: topped_up\; scan
 s: mid
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-DRP-004-close@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270329
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270330
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-DRP-004: Day 5 (you and office)
DESCRIPTION:Day 5: last photo and count (template 08)\; collect leftovers 
 (brand chose return) or leave them (release). At the end of the day turn o
 ff 'Accepting responses' on every campaign survey form and read every link
  total (close).\nLog it in: counts: remaining_day5\; photos: later\; inven
 tory: collected or released_to_office\; scans: close
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
